<h1>quin.fyi</h1>
<p>Hi, I'm Quin, a nonbinary systems hacker who loves nothing more than diving into the lowest level of any system. I know over 15 programming languages, with my current favorites being Rust, Zig, and C++.</p>
<p>I'm probably best known for writing <a href="https://paperback.dev">Paperback</a>, <a href="https://github.com/trypsynth/fedra">Fedra</a>, and <a href="https://github.com/trypsynth/backtalk">Backtalk</a>, but I love coming up with solutions to problems, so the list of things I have or currently work on is much more extensive.</p>
<p>This is where I write about stuff, if that's at all interesting to you.</p>
